summary:
  The heartbeat ticks once a minute again.

history:
  Its first tick after a wake then lands after the relay writer's curl has
  redialled (32 s into a silent socket) and last night's station plays first.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          interval: 10000
          repeat: true
          running: root._wantsPlaying && isPlaying()

replace:
          interval: 60000
          repeat: true
          running: root._wantsPlaying && isPlaying()

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_deadline_counts_from_when_the_order_was_last_heard.
  Line-neutral.
